#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid ""
"A delicate blend of soft pink roses and baby's breath, perfect for "
"expressing love and gratitude."
msgstr ""
"ການປະສົມປະສານອັນອ່ອນໂຍນຂອງດອກກຸຫຼາບສີບົວອ່ອນ ແລະ ດອກເບບີ້ບຣີດ, ເໝາະສົມຢ່າງຍິ່ງສຳລັບການສະແດງຄວ"
"າມຮັກ ແລະ ຄວາມຂອບໃຈ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Aline Turner, Bouquet Designer"
msgstr "Aline Turner, ຜູ້ອອກແບບຊໍ່ດອກໄມ້"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Aline is the mastermind behind our bespoke floral arrangements."
msgstr ""
"Aline ຄືຜູ້ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງການສ້າງສັນການຈັດດອກໄມ້ແບບພິເສດຕາມສັ່ງຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_kickoff
msgid "Bloom with Joy"
msgstr "ເບັ່ງບານດ້ວຍຄວາມສຸກ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid "Blushing Harmony"
msgstr "ຄວາມກົມກຽວອັນຫວານລະມຸນ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_image_text_overlap
msgid ""
"Brighten any corner of the globe with our express 24-hour worldwide flower "
"delivery service."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຄວາມສົດໃສໃຫ້ທຸກມຸມໂລກ ດ້ວຍບໍລິການສົ່ງດອກໄມ້ດ່ວນທົ່ວໂລກຕະຫຼອດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_freegrid
msgid "Bringing the Beauty of Nature to Your Space"
msgstr "ນຳເອົາຄວາມງົດງາມຂອງທຳມະຊາດມາສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງທ່ານ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid "Celebrate with Our Best-Selling Bouquets, perfect for every occasion."
msgstr "ສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງດ້ວຍຊໍ່ດອກໄມ້ທີ່ຂາຍດີທີ່ສຸດຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ເໝາະສຳລັບທຸກໆໂອກາດ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid "Discover Our Most Loved Arrangements"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນພົບຮູບແບບການຈັດດອກໄມ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມນິຍົມທີ່ສຸດຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_orchid.field_theme_utils__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "ຊື່ສະແດງ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid "Elegant Simplicity"
msgstr "ຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍທີ່ສະຫງ່າງາມ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_freegrid
msgid ""
"Enhance your surroundings with our exquisite floral arrangements and garden "
"designs. We offer a variety of options that bring the serenity and beauty of "
"nature into your home or workspace."
msgstr ""
"ເສີມສ້າງບັນຍາກາດອ້ອມຕົວທ່ານດ້ວຍການຈັດດອກໄມ້ອັນປານີດ ແລະ ການອອກແບບສວນຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ພວກເຮົາພ້ອມ"
"ມອບຫຼາຍທາງເລືອກທີ່ຈະນຳເອົາຄວາມສະຫງົບ ແລະ ຄວາມສວຍງາມຂອງທຳມະຊາດມາສູ່ເຮືອນ ຫຼື ບ່ອນເຮັດວຽກຂອງ"
"ທ່ານ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_freegrid
msgid "Explore Our Gardens"
msgstr "ສຳຫຼວດສວນຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_title
msgid ""
"Explore our handcrafted floral arrangements, each meticulously designed to "
"convey beauty, elegance, and a touch of nature's artistry."
msgstr ""
"ສຳຫຼວດການຈັດດອກໄມ້ເຮັດດ້ວຍມືຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ແຕ່ລະຊຸດຖືກອອກແບບຢ່າງພິຖີພິຖັນ ເພື່ອສື່ເຖິງຄວາມງົດງາມ, ຄວາ"
"ມສະຫງ່າງາມ ແລະ ສິລະປະແຫ່ງທຳມະຊາດ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_theme_orchid
msgid "Florist, Gardens, Flowers, Nature, Green, Beauty, Stores"
msgstr "ຮ້ານດອກໄມ້, ສວນ, ດອກໄມ້, ທຳມະຊາດ, ສີຂຽວ, ຄວາມງາມ, ຮ້ານຄ້າ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_kickoff
msgid "Fresh Flowers Delivered to Your Doorstep!"
msgstr "ສົ່ງດອກໄມ້ສົດເຖິງໜ້າປະຕູເຮືອນຂອງທ່ານ!"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_image_text_overlap
msgid "Global 24-Hour Flower Delivery"
msgstr "ບໍລິການສົ່ງດອກໄມ້ທົ່ວໂລກ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_orchid.field_theme_utils__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Iris Joe, Customer Relations"
msgstr "Iris Joe, ພົວພັນລູກຄ້າ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Iris ensures that each customer has a delightful experience."
msgstr "Iris ຮັບປະກັນວ່າລູກຄ້າທຸກຄົນຈະໄດ້ຮັບປະສົບການທີ່ໜ້າປະທັບໃຈ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid ""
"Light pink blossoms with golden leaves, bringing a touch of springtime charm "
"to any space."
msgstr ""
"ດອກໄມ້ສີບົວອ່ອນພ້ອມໃບສີຄຳ, ນຳເອົາກິ່ນອາຍແຫ່ງລະດູໃບໄມ້ປົ່ງມາສູ່ທຸກພື້ນທີ່."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Meet the Team"
msgstr "ພົບກັບທີມງານ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Mich Stark, Operations Manager"
msgstr "Mich Stark, ຜູ້ຈັດການຝ່າຍປະຕິບັດການ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Mich makes sure everything runs smoothly."
msgstr "Mich ເບິ່ງແຍງໃຫ້ທຸກຢ່າງດຳເນີນໄປຢ່າງຮຽບຮ້ອຍ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid ""
"Minimalist white florals in a sleek vase, embodying sophistication and grace."
msgstr ""
"ດອກໄມ້ສີຂາວແບບລຽບງ່າຍໃນແຈກັນທີ່ຫຼູຫຼາ, ສະທ້ອນເຖິງຄວາມມີລະດັບ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫງ່າງາມ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_theme_orchid
msgid "Orchid Theme"
msgstr "ຊຸດຮູບແບບ Orchid"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_title
msgid "Our Creations"
msgstr "ຜົນງານສ້າງສັນຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid "Petal Poetry"
msgstr "ບົດກະວີແຫ່ງກີບດອກໄມ້"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_orchid
msgid ""
"Sales-led header above a kickoff hero opens onto key visuals, a process-"
"steps narrative, a freegrid showcase, an image-text-overlap layout, and a "
"basic team block before an image wall, accented by a varied vocabulary of "
"connection, organic blob, and bold geometric motifs. Process-and-image "
"driven / suited for florists, garden centers, beauty boutiques, and nature-"
"led retail"
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫົວທີ່ເນັ້ນການຂາຍ ເທິງສ່ວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼັກ ເປີດໄປສູ່ພາບທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນ, ການເລົ່າເລື່ອງຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນ, ການສະແດງແ"
"ບບຕາໜ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ, ການຈັດວາງຮູບພາບຊ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ແລະ ບລັອກທີມງານພື້ນຖານກ່ອນໜ້າກຳແພງຮູບພາບ, ຕົກແຕ່"
"ງດ້ວຍລວດລາຍເລຂາຄະນິດທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງທຳມະຊາດ. ເນັ້ນຂະບວນການ ແລະ ຮູບພາບ / ເໝາະສຳລັບຮ້າ"
"ນຂາຍດອກໄມ້, ສູນຈັດສວນ, ຮ້ານເສີມຄວາມງາມ, ແລະ ຮ້ານຄ້າຂາຍຍ່ອຍທີ່ເນັ້ນທຳມະຊາດ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid "Sunset Serenade"
msgstr "ສຽງເພງຍາມຕາເວັນຕົກດິນ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_orchid.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຮູບແບບ"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Tony Fred, Floral Director"
msgstr "Tony Fred, ຜູ້ອຳນວຍການຝ່າຍຈັດດອກໄມ້"

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_company_team_basic
msgid "Tony leads the creative vision for the shop."
msgstr "Tony ເປັນຜູ້ນຳພາວິໄສທັດດ້ານຄວາມຄິດສ້າງສັນຂອງຮ້ານ."

#. module: theme_orchid
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_orchid.s_key_images
msgid ""
"Vibrant hues of orange and red capture the warmth and beauty of a summer "
"evening."
msgstr ""
"ສີສັນອັນສົດໃສຂອງສີສົ້ມ ແລະ ສີແດງ ຖ່າຍທອດຄວາມອົບອຸ່ນ ແລະ ຄວາມງົດງາມຂອງຕອນແລງໃນລະດູຮ້ອນ."
